From: RealHaltewunsch <julius.merz@web.de>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:16:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Correct Compact-500 nozzle rotation directions

Invert both nozzle outputs so positive A and B rotate counterclockwise viewed from above, as verified on hardware.
---
 Marlin/Configuration.h | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Marlin/Configuration.h b/Marlin/Configuration.h
index 31049c9b93..9a9d2dc2be 100644
--- a/Marlin/Configuration.h
+++ b/Marlin/Configuration.h
@@ -1708,8 +1708,8 @@
 #define INVERT_X_DIR false
 #define INVERT_Y_DIR false
 #define INVERT_Z_DIR false
-#define INVERT_I_DIR true
-#define INVERT_J_DIR true
+#define INVERT_I_DIR false
+#define INVERT_J_DIR false
 #define INVERT_K_DIR false
 //#define INVERT_U_DIR false
 //#define INVERT_V_DIR false
-- 
