From 69ecfcf7c652d0422602e4276d994e3088f87779 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RealHaltewunsch <julius.merz@web.de>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:41:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Control Compact-500 enclosure fan from TMC thermal
 warnings

Run J15 at full duty for three seconds at startup, then use 50% PWM. Poll all TMC drivers every 500 ms and switch to full duty until a complete poll reports no active overtemperature warning. Keep configured driver currents.
---
